{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22015","headline":"读史五首 一 · 白居易","name":"读史五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚怀放灵均，国政亦荒淫。\n彷徨未忍决，绕泽行悲吟。\n汉文疑贾生，谪置湘之阴。\n是时刑方措，此去难爲心。\n士生一代间，谁不有浮沈。\n良时真可惜，乱世何足钦。\n乃知汨罗恨，未抵长沙深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22015.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22015","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}